{"id":"memorial_104802","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial104800","label":"Memoirs · Upside-Down Record"},"label":"Page 2","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_104801","next":"memorial_104803","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_104802_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"Everyone brought the materials Levi requested."},{"id":"memorial_104802_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"To my astonishment, I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, had gathered the fewest."},{"id":"memorial_104802_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, overheard something."},{"id":"memorial_104802_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"Ziz carried the materials with her enormous wings, while Behemoth gathered hers with colossal pincers."},{"id":"memorial_104802_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, was utterly taken aback."},{"id":"memorial_104802_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I have neither gargantuan wings nor a colossal pincer."},{"id":"memorial_104802_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, pondered."},{"id":"memorial_104802_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"Ah, so that is the secret to amassing such quantities!"},{"id":"memorial_104802_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, pondered once more."},{"id":"memorial_104802_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"I, too, must employ tools!"},{"id":"memorial_104802_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_48_02_description","text":"Truly, I, the unparalleled clever Bahamut, am the epitome of genius!"}]}